==Rustboro City==
[[File:Rustboro City RS.png|thumb|Rustboro City]]

[[Rustboro City]] links {{rt|104|Hoenn}} to the south, {{rt|116|Hoenn}} to the east, and {{rt|115|Hoenn}} to the north. Every building is constructed from stone, giving the city an old-fashioned appearance. It is the main hub of manufacturing in the [[Hoenn]] region, with the [[Devon Corporation]] as its beating heart.

