===Cutter's house===
The house to the west of the Pokémon Center belongs to a man known as the Cutter. When the city was expanding, he taught his Pokémon a move to help clear the surrounding land of trees. He no longer needs his {{HM|01|Cut}}, and, recognizing you as a skilled Trainer, decides to pass it on to you. When used in the field, this move allows the user to remove [[cuttable plant|small trees]] in order to reach new areas.

===Pokémon Trainer's School===
The [[Pokémon Trainers' School|Pokémon Trainer's School]] stands to the northeast of the Pokémon Center. Speak to the teacher to receive a [[Quick Claw]], and brush up on the basics by reading the notes on the blackboard.

