===Devon Corporation===
[[Devon Corporation]] is headquartered in a large stone building in the northwest part of town. The company is responsible for manufacturing many of the items Trainers rely on every day, including several variations of Poké Ball and medicine. Only authorized personnel are allowed past the first floor.

===Time for a Trade===
Visit the house in the northeast part of town to find a boy who would like to [[trade]] Pokémon. He is willing to part with his {{p|Makuhita}} in exchange for a {{p|Slakoth}}. Slakoth can be found nearby in [[Petalburg Woods]]. Makuhita arrives holding an [[X Attack]].

===Rustboro Gym===
[[File:Rustboro Gym RS.png|thumb|Rustboro Gym]]

