After the battle, Roxanne awards you the {{badge|Stone}}, which boosts a Pokémon’s physical {{stat|Attack}} by 10% during battle and enables the use of {{m|Cut}} in the field. She also gives you {{TM|39|Rock Tomb}} as a prize.

===Stop, Thief!===
When you leave the Gym, you witness a Grunt from [[Team Magma]]{{sup/3|R}}/[[Team Aqua]]{{sup/3|S}} escaping from the Devon Corporation building. That same Devon researcher from earlier is close behind, and chases the thief northward. He loses track of him in the northeast, where the city connects to {{rt|116|Hoenn}}. Recognizing you from [[Petalburg Woods]], he explains that the Grunt just robbed him of some valuable [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]], and begs for your help.

