===Kidnapped!===
When you reach the entrance to [[Rusturf Tunnel]], you find an elderly man standing there. It seems that the thief has added kidnapping to his list of charges, as he has also made off with the man's beloved {{p|Wingull}}, [[Peeko]]!

==Rusturf Tunnel==
[[File:Rusturf Tunnel RS.png|thumb|Rusturf Tunnel]]

[[Rusturf Tunnel]] was a construction project by [[Devon Corporation]] that aimed to link [[Rustboro City]] and western [[Hoenn]] to the rest of the region. The tunnel was nearly complete when Devon's president, [[Mr. Stone]], realized that the work was disturbing the local {{p|Whismur}} population. The project was canceled, though only a small bit of debris, {{m|Rock Smash|easily cleared}}, remained to hinder travel.

