===The Take Down===
The tunnel is fairly small, so you will find the thief and his hostage shortly after you step inside. Unfortunately for him, his escape route is blocked by rocky debris. Defeat him, and he gives up the [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]] before fleeing. The old man rushes in to check on [[Peeko]], and introduces himself as [[Mr. Briney]] before the pair leaves for his home near [[Petalburg Woods]].

==Rustboro City==
[[File:Hoenn RSE Map.png|thumb|The PokéNav's Map]]
===The Returning Hero===
With the [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]] reclaimed, return to the Devon researcher in the northeast part of the city. As thanks for your help, he gives you a [[Great Ball]] before accompanying you to [[Devon Corporation]] to meet his boss.

===Devon Corporation===
====A New Task====
The man leads you to the president's office on the third floor. He asks if you would deliver the [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]] to [[Slateport City]]'s shipyard, as he is afraid of the thief returning. He leaves you for a moment, and soon returns to say that the president would like to speak with you.

====Devon's President, Mr. Stone====
The company president introduces himself as [[Mr. Stone]], and thanks you for reclaiming the stolen goods. Having heard that you will be delivering the package to [[Slateport City]], he wonders if you could stop off in [[Dewford Town]] on the way. He gives you a [[Letter]] addressed to a man named [[Steven Stone|Steven]], and hopes that you could deliver it for him. He does not expect you to work for free, of course, and rewards you with a [[PokéNav]]. This high-tech device has several different functions.

